        BUILDING SUSTAINABLE MEDIA FOR ZIMBABWE
        Theme: Local Technology for Efficient Newsrooms, Loyal Audiences, and New Revenue
        EFFICIENT NEWSROOMS: Traditional media platforms are collapsing under the weight of expensive cloud licensing fees and massive processing bloat. Newsrooms need locally compiled, zero-dependency tools running on standard available desktop hardware to keep operating costs at zero.
        LOYAL AUDIENCES: Ordinary citizens face massive data constraints. Web pages flooded with heavy layout nodes, presentation styles, and commercial ad blocks make loading essential journalism a luxury. Compressing data footprints builds deep loyalty through immediate financial relief for the consumer.
